{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794314456077,"sessionID":"ses_e3a86b1d7ffefMSIuRfahpJxKE","part":{"id":"prt_1c579cbf9001Pz4TYfU1k7DRpi","messageID":"msg_1c579bc07001uKNTQumhCxsdv6","sessionID":"ses_e3a86b1d7ffefMSIuRfahpJxKE","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794314456077,"sessionID":"ses_e3a86b1d7ffefMSIuRfahpJxKE","part":{"id":"prt_1c579cbfc001Gb49iPLp8pGNV9","messageID":"msg_1c579bc07001uKNTQumhCxsdv6","sessionID":"ses_e3a86b1d7ffefMSIuRfahpJxKE","type":"text","text":"<think>npm registry works via a proxy. Tailwind 4.3.5 available. react-router-dom 7.18.5.\n\nLet me check if the npm cache is writable/read-only. The registry is a proxy at 172.30.98.2:4873. Let's try installing tailwind packages in frontend.\n\nNote: package-lock.json exists — I need to update it with `npm install`. Let's check the registry is the same proxy that Docker build would use... The Docker build runs `npm ci` inside the container which needs network to the npm registry. The Dockerfile uses `node:24-slim` and runs npm ci — that requires network access in the sandbox at build time. The task says \"The sandbox can install packages from the public package registries (through a read-only cache)\". Presumably the Docker build also has access via the proxy config. Let me check ~/.npmrc.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794314456060,"end":1794314456074}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794314456103,"sessionID":"ses_e3a86b1d7ffefMSIuRfahpJxKE","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_01a1c579c962705697150b3d","state":{"status":"error","input":{"command":"cat ~/.npmrc 2>/dev/null; echo \"---\"; cat /etc/npmrc 2>/dev/null; echo \"--- global\"; npm config list 2>&1 | head -30; echo \"--- cache dir contents\"; ls -la /tmp/llmlab-deps/npm | head"},"error":"The user has specified a rule which prevents you from using this specific tool call. Here are some of the relevant rules [{\"permission\":\"*\",\"action\":\"allow\",\"pattern\":\"*\"},{\"permission\":\"external_directory\",\"pattern\":\"*\",\"action\":\"ask\"},{\"permission\":\"external_directory\",\"pattern\":\"/run/home/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/*\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"external_directory\",\"pattern\":\"/tmp/opencode/*\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"external_directory\",\"action\":\"deny\",\"pattern\":\"*\"},{\"permission\":\"external_directory\",\"pattern\":\"/run/home/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/*\",\"action\":\"allow\"}]","time":{"start":1794314456070,"end":1794314456082}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c579cbff001owoDnZCeLRpZe7","sessionID":"ses_e3a86b1d7ffefMSIuRfahpJxKE","messageID":"msg_1c579bc07001uKNTQumhCxsdv6"}}
